# Repo is LF-canonical. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# writes CRLF into the worktree while blobs stay LF, so `prettier --check` (part of
# `npm run check`, the DoD gate) fails on files nobody touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets are never line-ending converted. (`text=auto` already
# auto-detects binary; these are belt-and-braces for formats we expect.)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.basis binary
